<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{ alert.title }}</title>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #0B0D10; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #E8EAF0; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 480px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
        .card { background: #161820; border-radius: 20px; padding: 40px 32px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
        .logo { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #B060FF; letter-spacing: -0.5px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
        h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #E8EAF0; }
        p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #9BA3B8; margin: 0 0 24px; }
        .item { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 16px 0; }
        .item h2 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 6px; color: #E8EAF0; }
        .item p { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #3DDC97; color: #0B0D10; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
        .footer { font-size: 12px; color: #4B5268; margin-top: 24px; text-align: center; }
        .footer a { color: #9BA3B8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="logo">IWasThere</div>
        <h1>🎫 {{ alert.title }}</h1>
        {% if alert.items|length == 1 %}
            <p>{{ alert.items[0].body }}</p>
            <a href="{{ alert.items[0].url }}" class="btn">Ouvrir la page Ticketmaster</a>
        {% else %}
            <p>{{ alert.items|length }} événements que tu suis :</p>
            {% for item in alert.items %}
            <div class="item">
                <h2>{{ item.title }}</h2>
                <p>{{ item.body }}</p>
                <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="btn">Ouvrir la page Ticketmaster</a>
            </div>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        {% if fallback %}
            Tu reçois cet e-mail parce que la notification push ne t'est pas parvenue.<br>
        {% endif %}
        Tu suis {{ alert.items|length > 1 ? 'ces événements' : 'cet événement' }} depuis tes veilles IWasThere.
        Les alertes portent sur la mise en vente générale, pas sur les préventes.<br>
        Le contenu événementiel provient de Ticketmaster.
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
